type: software
title: "Furnace Commander: Interactive Combustion Optimization Game and AI Control Demonstration"
abstract: "An interactive furnace simulation game and AI control demonstration that teaches combustion optimization principles through engaging gameplay and showcases the power of machine learning in industrial control systems. Features a LiquidNN neural network for autonomous furnace control, real-time temperature management, and air/fuel ratio optimization."
